  "methodology_description": "This fictional preview ranks individual survivors by current-season performance across all killer characters among players eligible at generation time. Scores are hand-authored illustrations, not model output. The entry rating defined in the survivor board eligibility.rating description is an equal-weight average of survivor ratings against all available killer characters; it gates eligibility and does not directly contribute to the ranking score. The survivor gate retains a minimum of 300 blended points and more than 5 matches against eligible killer players. For this sample, an opposing killer player is eligible when their current entry rating for every killer character they use in the included matches is at least 1200 points and they have more than 10 current-season PUG matches against eligible survivors, counted across all killer characters. Each match counts once for each participant. All shown participants satisfy their applicable requirements at generation time; individual entry ratings are private and eligibility is a publisher guarantee. Killer players need no published ranking row to appear as eligible opponents. No repeat-encounter limits apply; all repeated matches remain included. Result counts describe the survivor side outcome, not personal escape. Parties describe who queued together in each match; every survivor retains an individual ranking. Opponent counts count distinct killer players, not killer characters, and the same killer player counts once even when they use several characters.",
