      "eligibility": {
        "rating": {
          "id": "pug-survivor-all-killers-equal-weight-blend-v1",
          "label": "Overall survivor entry-rating blend",
          "description": "Arithmetic mean of per-killer survivor entry ratings across all killer characters available in the PUG competition at snapshot generation time, with equal weight for each killer. The set covers all available killers, not only those appearing in the included matches. Each component uses the same illustrative 0–3000 point scale, so the blend also ranges from 0 to 3000 points, with higher values indicating stronger performance. Use current component ratings and compare the unrounded mean with the minimum. A rating must be available for every killer in that set; a missing component makes the player ineligible. This value gates eligibility only and is separate from the displayed ranking score. Individual component ratings and blended values are not published."
        },
        "minimum_rating_value": 300,
        "minimum_eligible_match_count": 6,
        "description": "At generation time, survivor players require the blended entry rating defined above to be at least 300 points and more than 5 current-season matches (at least 6) against eligible killer players, across all killer characters. Each match counts once, regardless of party membership or killer character. Repeated encounters count toward participation. Eligibility is reevaluated on every refresh, including without new matches. Missing blend components make a player ineligible. Opposing killer eligibility is explained in methodology_description; it does not require a published killer board."
      }
